    {
      "id": "claim_27c3065933484ddbb4dc6ea2e6c54c39",
      "statement": "SmsReceiver (exported with android.permission.BROADCAST_SMS, intent filters of priority 999 for both SMS_RECEIVED and SMS_DELIVER) dedupes by role: when the app IS the default SMS app, SMS_DELIVER owns the row and any SMS_RECEIVED for the same PDU is skipped; when NOT default, only SMS_RECEIVED fires and the system default app writes the inbox row, which the app's SmsContentObserver then picks up.",
