    {
      "id": "claim_c238da8761e544088ca139bee60983e7",
      "statement": "SmsReceiver performs its heavy work (provider INSERT plus read-back) inside goAsync() on a spawned thread with pending.finish() in a finally block so the system cannot kill the process mid-INSERT; webhook and network work is dispatched only after persistence succeeded.",
