    {
      "id": "claim_5973bff0cd964ea294f3bd799bbf6838",
      "statement": "SmsReceiver merges multipart PDUs into one concatenated body and resolves the canonical thread id up front via IncomingMessageDispatcher.resolveThreadId (Telephony.Threads.getOrCreateThreadId, returning 0L on failure); its INSERT into Telephony.Sms.Inbox writes ADDRESS, BODY, DATE, DATE_SENT, READ=0, SEEN=0, TYPE=MESSAGE_TYPE_INBOX, and the resolved THREAD_ID so the platform Threads table stays consistent.",
