        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_09b9e2712acd4bdab7c43945a70fbdbf",
      "statement": "For every non-blocked incoming message the dispatcher calls SmsRepository.invalidateAddressCaches(), which drops the process-wide AddressCache (canonical thread-to-address map and per-thread cache) so a brand-new sender re-resolves its contact name instead of rendering 'Unknown' on the next list refresh.",
