    {
      "id": "claim_862bd37ff18f4bab971715a2c7073946",
      "statement": "SmsEventBus is a fire-and-forget nudge (SharedFlow with no replay and extraBufferCapacity 64): HomeViewModel uses it to optimistically prepend the new conversation to the list, while the authoritative repaint comes from the Room Flow invalidation fired by the committed Upsert mutation — HomeViewModel deliberately performs no provider scan on the bus event.",
