      "id": "claim_8d57651b281042949c206fa3650e0da9",
      "statement": "Room may serve the UI only once both sources (sms and mms) have initialWindowReady, and the flag may flip only AFTER the conversations projection has been rebuilt from the mirrored messages, so the UI can never observe 'ready' against an empty projection; if the shadow DB cannot be opened, HomeViewModel disables the cutover and degrades to the provider path — the shadow is a read model and the provider remains the source of truth.",
