    {
      "id": "claim_f8cda0a9e3f845e894c810a2f92a577c",
      "statement": "MMS arrives through mmslib's manifest-declared PushReceiver/TransactionService, which persist the row into Telephony.Mms and then broadcast MMS_RECEIVED to MmsReceiver (not exported, found by taskAffinity); MmsReceiver reads the persisted row back (Mms.DATE seconds multiplied to ms, id negated per the repo-wide MMS-id convention, FROM address type 137 preferred, text/plain part as body) and dispatches with source=MessageEntity.SOURCE_MMS, which the coordinator maps back with abs(providerId) when keying the Room shadow.",
