      "statement": "NotificationHelper.showSmsNotification posts on the IMPORTANCE_HIGH messages_notification_channel with notification id = sender.hashCode() (per-sender dedupe), gated on POST_NOTIFICATIONS for Android 13+; it highlights a 4-8 digit OTP on keyword triggers with a dedicated copy action, always adds an inline Reply (RemoteInput) and Mark-as-read action targeting NotificationActionReceiver, uses a tap intent carrying AppLaunchIntent.ACTION_OPEN_CONVERSATION with per-thread extras and data URI, sets VISIBILITY_PRIVATE, and quiet hours suppress only sound/vibration (the notification still appears).",
